{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026HE7cEDIigL1795152202.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>承接外圍跌勢，港股一度急挫逾500點。</p><p></p><p>恒指低開359點後，大市沽壓持續，最多跌過508點，低見22,300點水平。</p><p></p><p>科網股走勢分歧，網易急挫一成七，為表現最差藍籌。快手也跌百分之9。但阿里巴巴業績後有追捧，急升百分之4。</p><p></p><p>晶片股也向下，華虹跌百分之8，中芯跌百分之2。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:02.019190+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T03:57:11.142107+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:25.508227+00:00","content_hash":"00c7509d8fdc5ed47504274fca123fea59ece9a90e6149b0f626f263de9bbc6a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:02.019190+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}